    "body": "> When would one declare style x-foo multiple times or even have a dynamic selector declaration? Honest question.\r\n\r\nInline styling is a thing, when I was working on web components it was *much* easier to have the styles embedded within the component itself instead of in a separate document.  AFAIK this syntax is already considered a mistake by the JSX community.  Maintainers can override if they wish.",
