    "body": "I'm leaning towards having multiple tags to replicate EJS's control flow, escaping, and whitespace elimination features.  I would be more partial to `<= >` for no escaping, `<# >` for HTML escaping, `<! >` for comments that are removed from the output, `<=_ _>` for whitespace removal, and `<=__ __>` for multi-line whitespace removal.   ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
